      "created_at": "2014-03-02T19:26:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would say it works for each individual card, since it specifies \"when you discard <span class=\"bbcode-i\">a</span> card\" - with something like Recompile you're discarding up to three, so each one of those thre (if that how many you chose to discard) would be <span class=\"bbcode-i\">a</span> card, therefore allowing the effect to occur three times.</p>",
