      "created_at": "2014-03-03T15:06:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thats how I read it as well. Because the card isn't Limited, and it says&nbsp;<em>a</em> card, I also say it double stacks for having multiple Criticals in play</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Trigger is discarding a card. Doesn't matter why, how, or when - anything that forces you to discard will trigger critical multiplier, each time you discard a card.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Which makes Citizen Sweat cry a little inside.</p>",
